#: templates/admin/gl/opening_balance.html:34
msgid ""
"Opening balance is posted as one journal (source OPENING_BALANCE). CSV "
"columns: kode_akun/account_code, debit, kredit/credit. Numbers may use "
"1.234.567,89 or 1234567.89. Total debit must equal total credit and the date "
"must fall in an OPEN period."
msgstr ""
"Saldo awal diposting sebagai satu jurnal (sumber OPENING_BALANCE). Format "
"CSV: kolom kode_akun/account_code, debit, kredit/credit. Angka boleh "
"1.234.567,89 atau 1234567.89. Total debit harus sama dengan total credit, "
"dan tanggal harus di period yang masih OPEN."

